{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">內地股市四大指數全線反彈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當中深圳創業板指數升幅較大，收市升逾百分之1.5。滬深300指數重回4,600點水平。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">滬深京三市成交逾2.3萬億元人民幣。食品及乳業股上升。光刻機和存儲晶片板塊則受壓。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T09:00:30.139838+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}